  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RSS/NERC - MENA NEXUS initiativ f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;rnyelsebar energi tekniker</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RSS/NERC - MENA Region Initiative - a NEXUS Approach &amp; Renewable Energy Tech - Enhancing the Role of MENA Region Municipalities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RSS/NERC has applied for funding of 48 000 000 MSEK to carry out the programme &quot;The MENA Region Intiative as a Model of NEXUS Approach and Renewable Energy Technologies &quot; during the period 2016-2019.

The intervention aims to enhance the capacity of MENA Municipalities as local authorities to promote needed reforms and innovations in the field of Sustainable Development and Green Economy, by boosting resilience to current climate variability through the use of ren energy and energy efficiency applications, saving water and enhance  institutional strengthening of the relevant government authorities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Royal Scientific Society/National Energy Research Center (RSS/NERC) har ans&#xF6;kt till Sida om st&#xF6;d p&#xE5; 48 MSEK f&#xF6;r att genomf&#xF6;ra projektet &quot;The MENA Region Initiative as a model of NEXUS Approach and Renewable Energy Technologies&quot; i MENA regionen med ett fokus p&#xE5; l&#xE4;nderna Jordanien, Libanon och Tunisien under perioden 2017-2020. 

Den f&#xF6;reslagna insatsen syftar till att st&#xE4;rka kapaciteten hos kommuner i MENA regionen vad g&#xE4;ller h&#xE5;llbar utveckling och &quot;gr&#xF6;n ekonomi&quot; genom att st&#xE4;rka motst&#xE5;ndskraften mot klimatf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndringar genom &#xF6;kad anv&#xE4;ndning av f&#xF6;rnybar energi och &#xE5;tg&#xE4;rder f&#xF6;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra energieffektivitet. F&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttringar inom dessa omr&#xE5;den kommer ocks&#xE5; att leda till en f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad och mer effektiv vattenanv&#xE4;ndning. 

Insatsens totala budget &#xE4;r 50.5 MSEK och organisationens eget bidrag &#xE4;r 2.5 MSEK.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen regional cooperation within the MENA region through implementing NEXUS approach, integrating plans for renewable energy, energy efficiency, water management and food production tools at each municipalitys level, to combat poverty, provide opportunities for women, youth and other marginalized groups (including refugees), and alleviate climate change effects.</narrative>
  </description>
